{"id":"463696","name":"鱼头豆腐汤","author":"宁静致远0217","authorId":"9691953","desc":"","cover":"images/463696/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"清江鱼","amount":"1条"},{"name":"北豆腐","amount":"1块"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"味精","amount":"少许"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"清江鱼取鱼头，鱼尾，鱼骨，鱼肉另作他用。","img":"images/463696/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鱼头鱼尾，鱼骨放盐，料酒腌制20分钟。","img":"images/463696/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"葱姜蒜切碎，花椒加入。","img":"images/463696/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"炼葱姜蒜花椒油。","img":"images/463696/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中留油炒鱼头鱼骨鱼尾。","img":"images/463696/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"添开水稍煮，加入北豆腐。","img":"images/463696/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加盖焖煮15分钟。","img":"images/463696/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"熬至汤白。","img":"images/463696/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"转入砂锅中继续熬制半小时，然后放盐，白胡椒，少许味精调味，撒香菜即可。","img":"images/463696/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}